(a) CREATE VIEW TP(acctno, txdate, amount) AS SELECT T1.acctno, T1.date, T2.amount FROM transaction T1 JOIN transaction T2 ON T1.acctno=T2.acctno AND T2.date<=T1.date;
(b) CREATE VIEW V AS SELECT acctno, txdate, SUM(amount) AS balance FROM TP GROUP BY acctno, txdate;
SELECT acctno, MIN(balance) AS min_balance FROM V GROUP BY acctno;
Retain duplicates in TP: equal amounts from different transactions must each contribute to SUM. The daily cumulative balances include only actual transaction dates, excluding the initial zero.
